    "Create a transition that wipes color bands across the screen to reveal a second layer.",
    "A range of Color Stripe preset types give you one-click access to fully configured wipes. Simply keyframe the Mix duration (see below)&#160;and tune to taste! Find these presets via the blue Open Dashboard... button or the Choose a Preset... button below it.",
    "As with all other Universe tools, you can modify or create a Color Stripe look and then save it under its own name by pressing the Save Preset... button."
